#. i18n: file: kcalc.kcfg:63
#. i18n: ectx: whatsthis, entry (Precision), group (Precision)
#: rc.cpp:111
msgid ""
"\n"
"\tKCalc can compute with many more digits than the number that\n"
"\tfits on the display. This setting gives the maximum number of\n"
"\tdigits displayed, before KCalc starts using scientific notation,\n"
"\ti.e. notation of the type 2.34e12.\n"
"      "
msgstr ""
"\n"
"\tKCalc kan met baie meer syfers werk as die aantal wat inpas op\n"
"\tdie vertoonpaneel. Hier doen mens die opstelling van die aantal\n"
"\tsyfers wat vertoon word, voordat KCalc sal begin om wetenskaplike\n"
"\tnotasie te gebruik. Bv. 2.34e12 as die getal meer as 12 syfers het.\n"
"......"

